    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div> <div class="a-section"> <div class="a-section-inner"> <div class="a-section-num">03 · Palette</div> <h3 class="a-section-title">Almost no <em>colour</em>.<br>Five tones of the same paper.</h3> <p class="a-body">The palette is the palette of a quiet room with one window. Warm whites and stones. A single deep ink for type and structure. Range identification is handled through typography and context rather than colour, which means the brand reads as one calm whole rather than a series of brightly-coded ranges.</p>
