</div> <div class="a-section"> <div class="a-section-inner"> <div class="a-section-num">04 · Typography</div> <h3 class="a-section-title">Cormorant for <em>voice</em>.<br>Inter for everything else.</h3>
  <div class="a-type-stack">
    <div class="a-type-row">
      <div class="a-type-label">Display · Cormorant 300</div>
      <div class="a-type-specimen-1">The work of <em>looking after</em> skin properly.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="a-type-row">
      <div class="a-type-label">Body · Inter 300</div>
      <div class="a-type-specimen-2">Luminescence is the name of the range, but more than that, it is the name of a quiet conviction: that clarity and evenness are not effects applied to skin, but conditions that skin maintains when it is supported properly.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="a-type-row">
      <div class="a-type-label">Spec · Inter 500 caps</div>
      <div class="a-type-specimen-3">15% L-Ascorbic Acid · 1% Tocopherol · pH 3.2 · 30ml</div>
