</div> <div class="a-section"> <div class="a-section-inner"> <div class="a-section-num">05 · Photography</div> <h3 class="a-section-title">Still life,<br>not product shots.</h3> <p class="a-body">Single objects on warm stone, lit by one window. The product is not staged, it is observed. The reference is the still-life tradition rather than the beauty-counter tradition. No surfaces, no props, no monstera. Just the object, the light, the shadow, the time it took to set up properly.</p>
  <div class="a-photo a-photo-still">
    <div class="a-photo-caption">
      <span>No. 01 · Brightening Serum</span>
      <span>Morning light · 100mm · f/8</span>
