</div>
</div> <div class="c-section"> <div class="c-section-inner"> <div class="c-section-head"> <div class="c-section-num">02 · The Mark</div> <h3 class="c-section-title">Honeycomb, <em>amplified</em>.</h3> </div> <p class="c-body">The honeycomb gets promoted from small mark to main character. Set large. Used decoratively. The wordmark is Fraunces with a signature italic "a" — lifting a quiet custom detail into the mark without resetting it.</p>
