    <div>
      <h4>What this direction is best at</h4>
      <p>Commercial clarity. Merchandisability. A homepage that sells cleansers without apology. A founder who is a marketing asset, not a marketing absence. Warmth and personality that the category mostly lacks.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>What it trades off</h4>
      <p>International fit. Brightening and kojic acid carry complicated histories in the US, India and Africa. Durability — ties the brand to one range at a moment when the other ranges may need to grow. Requires Bianca to be genuinely comfortable as the face of the brand, for the long term.</p>
